Fix `DEFER_ON_TLS_ERROR=False` having no effect in the postfix container. The setting reaches `main.cf` and `mta-sts-daemon.yml` through jinja, which rendered it from `os.environ` -- where it is the string `"False"`, and a non-empty string is true, so `smtp_tls_dane_insecure_mx_policy` stayed at `dane` and `strict_testing` at `true` whatever the setting said. The admin container read the same setting correctly, so a deployment that turned it off got the stricter policy in postfix only. Also fix a `NameError` that replaced the error message for an unusable `PROXY_PROTOCOL` entry, such as a list written with spaces after the commas, with a traceback at container start.
